# Elite Prospects

> Elite Prospects is an ice-hockey statistics and records database, founded in 1999. EP maintains current career statistics, biographical data, transfers, drafts, tournaments, scouting reports, and league standings for hundreds of thousands of players across professional, junior, and amateur leagues worldwide.

Data is sourced from official league feeds, club partners, and the EP editorial team. Player profiles are the canonical entity — career statistics, transfers, awards, and draft history live there. Player pages follow `/player/{id}/{slug}`, team pages follow `/team/{id}/{slug}/{season}` (season-scoped, with the latest season as default), and league pages follow `/league/{slug}`.

## Players
- [Player search](https://www.eliteprospects.com/search/player): Search players by name, league, nationality, position, and draft year.

## Leagues
- [League index](https://www.eliteprospects.com/leagues): All covered leagues, including major professional, junior, and women's circuits worldwide.
- [NHL](https://www.eliteprospects.com/league/nhl): Standings, rosters, statistical leaders, and historical data for the National Hockey League.
- [SHL](https://www.eliteprospects.com/league/shl): Standings, rosters, statistical leaders, and historical data for the Swedish Hockey League.
- [AHL](https://www.eliteprospects.com/league/ahl): Standings, rosters, statistical leaders, and historical data for the American Hockey League.
- [KHL](https://www.eliteprospects.com/league/khl): Standings, rosters, statistical leaders, and historical data for the Kontinental Hockey League.
- [Liiga](https://www.eliteprospects.com/league/liiga): Standings, rosters, statistical leaders, and historical data for the Finnish top division.

## Teams
- [Team index](https://www.eliteprospects.com/teams): All covered clubs, browsable by league and country.

## Draft
- [Draft index](https://www.eliteprospects.com/draft): All major hockey drafts covered by EP, including the NHL Entry Draft and other professional and junior league drafts.

## Scouting & Prospects
- [Draft Center](https://www.eliteprospects.com/draft-center): NHL Draft prospect rankings, including Elite Prospects' own ranking and aggregated rankings from major scouting services.
- [Scouting Reports](https://www.eliteprospects.com/news/scouting-report): In-depth scouting reports, prospect analysis, and draft coverage from the Elite Prospects scouting team.

## Transfers
- [Transfers](https://www.eliteprospects.com/transfers): Real-time global hockey transfer activity.
- [NHL transfers](https://www.eliteprospects.com/transfers/nhl): Real-time NHL signings, trades, and roster movement.

## Stats
- [Stats hub](https://www.eliteprospects.com/stats): Career-leading scorers, single-season records, and active-player leaderboards across NHL, SHL, AHL, KHL, Liiga, and other covered leagues.

## About
- [About Elite Prospects](https://www.eliteprospects.com/about): Company history, methodology, and data sourcing.
- [Enterprise](https://landing.eliteprospects.com/enterprise): Information about EP's hockey data, scouting, and analytics services for clubs and media.
